    {
      "text": "正面概率只有20%，十连正面的原始概率低至九百七十六万分之一",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The game practices true randomness; it is possible that the first ten times you flip the coin will be all heads. However, it's exceedingly unlikely; with a 20% chance of flipping heads each time, your odds of getting ten in a row are one in 9,765,625.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3925760/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "连续正面可升级硬币提高胜率，但永远无法保证成功",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "As you play, you can push the odds to be more in your favor, chaining heads together to upgrade your coin. However, getting ten heads in a row will never be guaranteed.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3925760/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "人类灭绝后，无脸生物戴着绝种动物面具复刻旧制度",
      "dimension": "题材",
      "excerpt": "The only remnants are faceless creatures who wear masks of long-extinct animals, repeating the systems of humans who have disappeared millennia ago.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3925760/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
